    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d161-f1" n="a" xml:id="d161-f1-content">
                <p>Neah Bay is in the State of Washington, and the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Pathfinder</hi> was seized thereon charges made against her in the Behring
                    Sea in the previous year. She was released two days later.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
